      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6a96baf8c7795fb98c8c35fe",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I think it would be nice to be able to upload additional photos of your world after uploading, so that players can get a better feel of what your world is like before loading in. \nUploading more photos directly from the VRchat website would also allow you to use more than just VRC cameras placed in your scene.\nFor example, screen shots of players having a good time in your world.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Photo Gallery for Uploaded Worlds",
